%description:
TcpCubic keeps ssthresh at a second retransmission timeout of the same
segment (RFC 5681 section 3.1: equation (4) applies only when "the given
segment has not yet been resent by way of the retransmission timer"). The
tester drops the flight of 8 segments at t=1.213 and the first
retransmission of its first segment. At the first timeout, CUBIC sets
ssthresh to beta * cwnd (5 segments); at the second timeout, cwnd is 1
segment, and ssthresh stays 5 segments.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true

*.tcptester.cmdenv-log-level=DEBUG
*.cli_tcp.**.cmdenv-log-level=DETAIL
**.cmdenv-log-level=OFF

*.*_tcp.tcpAlgorithmClass = "TcpCubic"

*.cli_app.tSend=1s
*.cli_app.sendBytes=16384B # 16 1024-byte segments

*.tcptester.script="a10 delete; a11 delete; a12 delete; a13 delete; a14 delete; a15 delete; a16 delete; a17 delete; a18 delete"  # the flight of 8 segments at t=1.213, and its first retransmission

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%# the first timeout: ssthresh = beta * cwnd
%contains: stdout
Loss at cwnd=8 segments, in flight=8 segments
Begin Slow Start: resetting cwnd to 1024, ssthresh=5120

%# the second timeout of the same segment: ssthresh stays
%contains: stdout
Performing retransmission #2; increasing RTO from 2s  to 4s, and cancelling RTT measurement
recover=15360
Loss Recovery terminated.
Begin Slow Start: resetting cwnd to 1024, ssthresh=5120

%contains: stdout
[4.427 B010] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 16385 win 16384

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
